### 공통 변수
# Gateway : http://localhost:8000
# Direct  : http://localhost:10005
# Bearer 토큰은 실제 Keycloak 토큰으로 교체 필요
# X-User-Id, X-User-Role은 게이트웨이가 미주입 → 직접 추가

### ============================================================
### Gateway 경유 (실제 환경과 동일)
### ============================================================

### 1. 배달 목록 조회 (Gateway)
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/deliveries
Authorization: Bearer dummy-token-for-local
X-User-Id: 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
X-Role: MASTER

### 2. 배달 생성 (Gateway) - hub-service Feign 호출 발생
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/deliveries
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer dummy-token-for-local
X-User-Id: 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
X-Role: MASTER

{
  "orderId": "bbbbbbbb-0000-0000-0000-000000000099",
  "sourceHubId": "dddddddd-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "vendorId": "dddddddd-0000-0000-0000-000000000003"
}

### 3. 특정 배달 조회 (Gateway)
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/deliveries/aaaaaaaa-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
Authorization: Bearer dummy-token-for-local
X-User-Id: 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
X-Role: MASTER

### 4. 배달의 배송 목록 조회 (Gateway)
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/deliveries/aaaaaaaa-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/shipments
Authorization: Bearer dummy-token-for-local
X-User-Id: 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
X-Role: MASTER

### ============================================================
### Direct (빠른 단위 테스트용 - gateway 우회)
### ============================================================

### 5. 배달 목록 조회 (Direct)
GET http://localhost:10005/api/v1/deliveries
X-User-Id: 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
X-Role: MASTER

### 6. 배달 생성 (Direct)
POST http://localhost:10005/api/v1/deliveries
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
X-Role: MASTER

{
  "orderId": "bbbbbbbb-0000-0000-0000-000000000099",
  "sourceHubId": "dddddddd-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "vendorId": "dddddddd-0000-0000-0000-000000000003"
}
